<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Backend/internal/migrate/migrate.go&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;package migrate&lt;/font&gt; — &lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;~ split&lt;/font&gt; is unexported; the halver &lt;a href=&quot;#func#migrate_Load&quot;&gt;migrate_Load&lt;/a&gt;() calls once per file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the two markers are the package-level consts sectionUp = &quot;-- +migrate Up&quot; and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;sectionDown = &quot;-- +migrate Down&quot;, declared in this file and carded nowhere&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;both halves live in one file on purpose — an up and its down are one reversible&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;change, and two files is an invitation to update one and not the other&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="100" width="700" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;func &lt;b&gt;split(&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;body string&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b&gt;)&lt;/b&gt; (up, down string, err error)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="700" y="390" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Returns the Up half and the Down half of the file body, both TrimSpace&#39;d, plus an&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;error that is nil on success. The error is non-nil when the body carries no&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&quot;-- +migrate Up&quot; marker, no &quot;-- +migrate Down&quot; marker, or an Up section that is empty&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;once trimmed; in all three cases both strings come back &quot;&quot;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;An empty Down is not an error here — refusing to roll that migration back is&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;ErrIrreversible&#39;s job, over in runner.go.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="120" width="700" y="450" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; return up, down, nil&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; return &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, fmt.Errorf(&quot;missing %q marker&quot;, sectionUp)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; return &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, fmt.Errorf(&quot;missing %q marker&quot;, sectionDown)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; return &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, errors.New(&quot;Up section is empty&quot;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="700" y="570" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;upAt := strings.Index(body, sectionUp)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if upAt &amp;lt; 0 { return &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, fmt.Errorf(&quot;missing %q marker&quot;, sectionUp) }&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;rest := body[upAt+len(sectionUp):]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;downAt := strings.Index(rest, sectionDown)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if downAt &amp;lt; 0 { return &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, fmt.Errorf(&quot;missing %q marker&quot;, sectionDown) }&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;up = strings.TrimSpace(rest[:downAt])&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;down = strings.TrimSpace(rest[downAt+len(sectionDown):])&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if up == &quot;&quot; { return &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, errors.New(&quot;Up section is empty&quot;) }&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return up, down, nil&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;anything before the Up marker is a file-level comment and is dropped — the slice starts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;after the marker, so the marker text never leaks into the SQL that gets executed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;an empty Up is rejected because a migration that applies nothing would still be recorded&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;as applied, permanently hiding the fact that its SQL was never written&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="420" width="700" y="650" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
